# Azshara - Completionist (pack butler-routes-completionist, v1).
# Every Azshara accept in the local census (52 quests,
# docs/azshara-census.md) appears exactly once as an accept; 49
# turnins close every record that has one in the data - 89015 Deadliest
# Catch, 91877 Demon Hunter's Hunter and 94316 Craftsman's Writ are
# accept-only records with no turn-in in the data (Ironforge/Redridge
# precedent: contracted with honest notes, never invented turn-ins),
# while 86747 Legashi Horns and 90813 Pay Dirt! are turn-in-only
# records carried with accept+turnin at their ender (Redridge 95795
# mirror). The 30 Horde quests, 9 above-band records and 3 repeatables
# are out with reasons in the census, plus the broken null pointer
# 96246. No race header and no race gates: nothing contracted is
# race-locked. Class gates: Hunter (8153/8231/8232), Rogue
# (8235/8236), Mage (8251/8252/8253), Priest (8255/8256/8257).
# Profession lines ride optional + when-skill gates. Soft-pre accepts
# whose blocking pre-quest sits outside the contract carry a note at
# the accept; their completes and turn-ins stand alone in when onquest
# mini-steps. Ungateable outside pres (2744 Swamp for 3141, 8151 for
# 8153, 8234 Alterac for 8235, 8250/8254 Ironforge for 8251/8255, 3449
# Ironforge for 3461) are reported as structural warnings.
guide butler-routes-completionist/azshara
title Azshara - Completionist
levels 45-55
zone Azshara
faction Alliance
category Leveling
folder Completionist
coords live
version 1

step South-west landfall - Truesong camp briefing

  zone map 1447

  note In from Ashenvale along the west coast: Commander Truesong (11.81,78.36), Berdun Cliffbrew (12.6,77.36) and Loh'atu (11.37,78.17) hold the landing. The Ekkal, Saria and Kim'jael legs below run east from here.
  accept 88807 -- Slay the Spitelash - Commander Truesong; warriors and screamers on the rise north-east
  complete 88807 @25.33,52.07 -- Spitelash Warriors for Truesong, the rise
  complete 88807 @25.68,50.93 -- Spitelash Screamers for Truesong, the rise
  turnin 88807 -- Slay the Spitelash - the word to Commander Truesong
  accept 88812 -- Reclaiming Ravencrest - Commander Truesong; a pointer with no field work
  turnin 88812 -- Reclaiming Ravencrest - the word back to Commander Truesong
  accept 88809 -- Preserving Eldarath - Commander Truesong; relics and Sarthiss in the south-center camps
  accept 88821 -- Making Contact - Commander Truesong; carry the word to Saria Fairmoon, central
  accept 92345 -- Beneath Nordrassil - Commander Truesong; the turn-in rides the Darnassus expedition below
  accept 5535 -- Spiritual Unrest - Loh'atu; apparitions and lichlings in the ruins north
  accept 5536 -- A Land Filled with Hatred - Loh'atu; Haldarr satyrs further north-east
  complete 5535 @14.51,72.3 -- Highborne Apparitions for Loh'atu, west ruins
  complete 5535 @14.58,72.62 -- Highborne Lichlings for Loh'atu, west ruins
  complete 5536 @19.22,62.67 -- Haldarr Satyrs for Loh'atu, north-east rise
  complete 5536 @19.35,61.81 -- Haldarr Tricksters and Felsworn for Loh'atu, same rise
  turnin 5535 -- Spiritual Unrest - the news to Loh'atu
  turnin 5536 -- A Land Filled with Hatred - the news to Loh'atu
  complete 88809 @37.72,54.35 -- Eldarath Relics (Spitelash camps, south-center)
  complete 88809 @35.85,58.52 -- Sarthiss (south-center camp)
  turnin 88809 -- Preserving Eldarath - relics and head to Commander Truesong
  accept 88813 -- The Head of the Serpent - Commander Truesong; Krellian waits in the central camp below

