  accept 89013 -- Gettin' Buzzed - Berdun Cliffbrew; honey off the wasps (note 91488 Home on the Range is the Horde twin listed as an alt pre - the Alliance route satisfies it via 89001 just turned in)
  accept 89228 -- Winter Frontier Fishery - Berdun Cliffbrew; squid have no placed source in the data (note 91488 as above)
  accept 90813 -- Pay Dirt! - Berdun Cliffbrew; the data carries no accept for this record, so the accept rides here at the ender with this note (Redridge 95795 mirror)
  accept 89015 optional -- Deadliest Catch - Berdun Cliffbrew; an accept-only record with no turn-in in the data (honest note, never an invented turn-in) - sharks below
  complete 89013 @17.25,49.23 -- Wild Honey (Honey Wasp, west hives)
  complete 90813 @16.82,53.81 -- Humongous Crystal (Cliff Walker, west stones)
  note 89228 Winter Squid has no placed source in the data - fish it anywhere and bring ten to Berdun.
  complete 89228
  turnin 89013 -- Gettin' Buzzed - the honey to Berdun Cliffbrew
  turnin 89228 -- Winter Frontier Fishery - the squid to Berdun Cliffbrew
  turnin 90813 -- Pay Dirt! - the crystal to Berdun Cliffbrew

