step Central camp - Ogtinc and Galen

  zone map 1447

  accept 8153 only Hunter -- Courser Antlers - Ogtinc; antlers off the Mosshoof coursers (note 8151 The Hunter's Charm accepts in Orgrimmar, contracted nowhere - the complete and turn-in stand alone in the when onquest mini-step below)
